### Record Attendance (teacher or admin)
POST http://localhost:3600/api/attendance
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

{
  "student_id": 1,
  "class_id": 1,
  "date": "2026-03-01",
  "status": "present"
}

###

### Record Another Student as Absent
POST http://localhost:3600/api/attendance
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

{
  "student_id": 4,
  "class_id": 1,
  "date": "2026-03-01",
  "status": "absent"
}

###

### Invalid Status (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:3600/api/attendance
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

{
  "student_id": 1,
  "class_id": 1,
  "date": "2026-03-01",
  "status": "excused"
}

###

### Get All Attendance
GET http://localhost:3600/api/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

###

### Filter by Class
GET http://localhost:3600/api/attendance?class_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

###

### Filter by Student
GET http://localhost:3600/api/attendance?student_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

###

### Filter by Date
GET http://localhost:3600/api/attendance?date=2026-03-01
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}